1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,203
Field Aide: voice advice for rainfed farmers
Team Kartik and Amrita
NASA Space Apps 2026: Adapting Farms with NASA Data

2
00:00:02,203 --> 00:00:06,006
1. One tap starts a call.
The app asks the questions aloud.

3
00:00:06,006 --> 00:00:16,832
2. Answer by voice or by touching a picture.
Eight short questions.

4
00:00:16,832 --> 00:00:20,632
3. Four ways to use the field through the year,
from 45 years of NASA POWER weather
and MODIS satellite data.

5
00:00:20,632 --> 00:00:25,735
4. Each colour is a crop, black is an empty field.
Every suggestion says what is not checked.

6
00:00:25,735 --> 00:00:27,374
Also in Hindi:
“Soybean, then sorghum. This is an estimated suggestion.”

7
00:00:27,374 --> 00:00:29,374
Supports, does not replace, local experts.
Next: all of India, more crops, orchards.
